<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-cream/5 bg-black/40 py-10 text-xs text-cream/60">
  <div class="section-shell flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-espresso to-bronze shadow-soft-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
        <div class="flex flex-col leading-tight">
          <span class="font-display text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-cream/50">Coffee</span>
          <span class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-cream">Los Andes</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-[11px] text-cream/60">
        Venezüella menşeli, uçtan uca kurgulanmış bir B2B kahve yolculuğu. Plantasyondan fincana kadar şeffaf, izlenebilir
        ve tutarlı.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-12">
      <div class="space-y-3">
