        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cream/70">İş Birlikleri</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          <li>Kafeler &amp; restoranlar</li>
          <li>Otel &amp; hospitality</li>
          <li>Kurumsal ofis çözümleri</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cream/70">İletişim</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          <li><a href="mailto:b2b@coffeelosandes.com" class="hover:text-cream">b2b@coffeelosandes.com</a></li>
          <li><span>+58 · Bölgesel ofis ağı</span></li>
